While playing with Lojban I found a little problem? I can say
{le nanmu cu prami le ninmu} and {le nanmu cu na prami le ninmu},
but how do I express that nobody loves her? {no lo nanmu cu prami
le ninmu} is the best version so far, {zo'e na prami le ninmu}
should be something like "somebody unimportant doesn't love the
woman".
 Is there a better way to say "Nobody love the woman"?

